@startuml US207-SSD
title System Sequence Diagram - US207: Register Airport with Enhanced Features

autonumber
actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
participant ":System" as Sys

BO -> Sys: Register airport with basic details, optional photos, and terminals (gates, services)
activate Sys

Sys --> BO: Returns created airport details and confirms success
deactivate Sys

@enduml
